OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are so many four-year-olds not
OL,4,Apotty-trained before school?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis week the charity announced its
OL,7,Fpotty-training scheme, which provides
OL,8,Fresources and support including
OL,9,Fincreased training for nurseries,
OL,10,Fschools and professionals, will be
OL,11,Frolled out in Solihull.
